00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:57,620
All right.

228
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:58,540
The origin of this complaint.

229
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:01,220
There are large group differences in IQ scores.

230
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,280
So Ashkenazi Jews, Jews of Eastern European ancestry,

231
