00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:12,720
than white Americans.

234
00:09:13,260 --> 00:09:14,220
I have nothing to do with this.

235
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,920
This all predates me.

236
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,800
Long before I was born, these numbers were there.

237
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:18,880
All right.

238
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,520
And out of people who know the data,

239
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:22,000
