240
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,460
The only question is why.

241
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,200
Question is why.

242
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,000
Why are there these large differences?

243
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,240
And a common complaint is

244
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:32,200
